.TH ENBAN 1 "2026-11-10" "enban" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
enban \- write, read, build and verify CD, DVD and Blu-ray discs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B enban
.RB [ \-\-theme
.IR name ]
.br
.B enban doctor
.br
.B enban version
.br
.B enban help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B enban
opens a full-screen app on a terminal. It draws in the terminal's alternate
screen, reads keys itself and gives the screen back when it ends, on
.B q
or on an interrupt. Digits switch tabs, and the left and right arrows move
between them. Without a terminal the app never opens.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
List the tools enban needs and whether each is installed. Exits non-zero only
when a required tool is missing.
.TP
.B version
Print the version and the platform.
.TP
.B help
Print the usage page.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " name"
Colours of the terminal interface:
.BR kodougu ,
.BR catppuccin\-mocha ,
.BR catppuccin\-latte ,
.BR dracula ,
.BR nord ,
.BR gruvbox ,
.B tokyo\-night
or
.BR mono .
The default is
.BR kodougu .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ENBAN_THEME
The theme when
.B \-\-theme
is not given.
.TP
.B KODOUGU_THEME
The theme of every kodougu tool, when neither
.B \-\-theme
nor
.B ENBAN_THEME
is set.
.TP
.B KODOUGU_ACCENT
A colour such as #CBA6F7 that replaces the accent of the theme.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Turns colour off in every theme.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on any failure or refusal.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR drutil (1),
.BR hdiutil (1),
.BR xorriso (1)
